       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. GRAVITY-REPORT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 GRAVITY-POLICY.
          05 POLICY-NAME          PIC X(24) VALUE SPACES.
          05 ANGLE-DEGREES        PIC 999V99 VALUE ZERO.
          05 STRENGTH-PERCENT     PIC 999 VALUE ZERO.
          05 STABILITY-PERCENT    PIC 999 VALUE ZERO.
       01 POLICY-STATUS           PIC X(24).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       VALIDATE-POLICY.
           IF ANGLE-DEGREES >= 360
               MOVE "REJECTED: BAD ANGLE" TO POLICY-STATUS
           ELSE IF STRENGTH-PERCENT > 100
               MOVE "REJECTED: BAD FORCE" TO POLICY-STATUS
           ELSE IF STABILITY-PERCENT < 40
               MOVE "APPROVED: EXPERIMENTAL" TO POLICY-STATUS
           ELSE MOVE "APPROVED: ORDINARY" TO POLICY-STATUS END-IF.
       PRINT-POLICY.
           DISPLAY "GRAVITY IS OPTIONAL / POLICY REPORT".
           DISPLAY "POLICY: " POLICY-NAME.
           DISPLAY "ANGLE:  " ANGLE-DEGREES.
           DISPLAY "FORCE:  " STRENGTH-PERCENT "%".
           DISPLAY "STATUS: " POLICY-STATUS.
           STOP RUN.
